   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2022-02-17",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Public Sector Superannuation Legislation Amendment Bill 2022 makes consequential amendments to the Parliamentary Superannuation Act 2004, the Superannuation Act 2005, and the Federal Circuit and Family Court of Australia Act 2021 to apply the Your Future, Your Super reforms to Commonwealth public sector superannuation, including stapling super accounts to members when they change jobs and establishing new default fund arrangements if a fund fails the annual performance test for two consecutive years."
  }
 ],
